{
  "version": 1,
  "comment": "Calibration baseline for today's ClientVadDetector: steps are [amplitudePcm16, clockAdvanceMsBeforeFrame]; expectations pin segment boundaries and voiced classification. A replacement detector proposes a reviewed delta to this file (G4 calibration), while the structural suite in client-vad-detector-semantics.test.ts must always pass unchanged.",
